1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,003
Speaking, task two. Card number 16. You are in a café. You want to throw a party for your colleagues. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:13,313
You are in a café. You want to throw a party for your colleagues.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,995
Hello. How can I help you?

4
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,267
Hello, do you have a free room for a party?

5
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:27,923
Yes, we have a private room for 20 people.

6
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:34,667
How much is it per person?

7
00:00:34,867 --> 00:00:37,484
It costs 350 crowns per person.

8
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:43,887
Can we have music?

9
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,400
Yes, you can play your own music.

10
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,533
Until what time can we stay?

11
00:00:53,733 --> 00:00:55,859
You can stay until 11 p.m.

12
00:00:56,067 --> 00:00:59,067
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,484
We look forward to seeing you.

14
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:08,914
Practise card 16 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
